# One line ending in the repository and on every checkout: LF. (Windows git defaults to converting to CRLF on
# checkout, which left half the working tree CRLF and made byte-exact gates and scripted edits depend on which.)
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
